    {"id":"sp-callsheet","x":300,"y":-340,"width":430,"height":390,"type":"text","text":"### Day 3 — call sheet\n\n- [x] Scout confirmed — golden hour 18:40\n- [x] Lens kit pulled: 32 / 50 / 85\n- [ ] Bounce + flags on the truck\n- [ ] Practicals dimmable, gelled to 2800K\n- [ ] Spare batteries for the night pickup\n- [ ] Show LUT loaded on the director's monitor","color":"#FFFFFF","vn":{"kind":"checklist","id":"sp-callsheet","title":"Day 3 — call sheet","color":"#FFFFFF","accentColor":"#F59E0B","items":[{"id":"sp-cs-1","text":"Scout confirmed — golden hour 18:40","done":true},{"id":"sp-cs-2","text":"Lens kit pulled: 32 / 50 / 85","done":true},{"id":"sp-cs-3","text":"Bounce + flags on the truck","done":false},{"id":"sp-cs-4","text":"Practicals dimmable, gelled to 2800K","done":false},{"id":"sp-cs-5","text":"Spare batteries for the night pickup","done":false},{"id":"sp-cs-6","text":"Show LUT loaded on the director's monitor","done":false}]}},

    {"id":"sp-plan","x":-740,"y":90,"width":680,"height":340,"type":"text","text":"### Lens & light\n\n| Shot | Lens | T | Key | Note |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 04A | 32mm | 2.8 | Sun, camera left | Let the sky carry it |\n| 04B | 50mm | 2.0 | 4×4 bounce, warm | Practicals build as sun drops |\n| 04C | 85mm | 1.4 | Single practical | Expose for the highlight |","color":"#FFFFFF","vn":{"kind":"table","id":"sp-plan","title":"Lens & light","color":"#FFFFFF","columns":[{"id":"sp-c-shot","label":"Shot","type":"text"},{"id":"sp-c-lens","label":"Lens","type":"text"},{"id":"sp-c-stop","label":"T","type":"text","align":"right"},{"id":"sp-c-key","label":"Key","type":"text"},{"id":"sp-c-note","label":"Note","type":"text"}],"rows":[{"id":"sp-r-a","cells":{"sp-c-shot":"04A","sp-c-lens":"32mm","sp-c-stop":"2.8","sp-c-key":"Sun, camera left","sp-c-note":"Let the sky carry it"}},{"id":"sp-r-b","cells":{"sp-c-shot":"04B","sp-c-lens":"50mm","sp-c-stop":"2.0","sp-c-key":"4×4 bounce, warm","sp-c-note":"Practicals build as sun drops"}},{"id":"sp-r-c","cells":{"sp-c-shot":"04C","sp-c-lens":"85mm","sp-c-stop":"1.4","sp-c-key":"Single practical","sp-c-note":"Expose for the highlight"}}]}},

    {"id":"sp-continuity","x":-30,"y":90,"width":300,"height":340,"type":"text","text":"### Continuity\n\nLight falls about 15 min faster here than [[Lighting Bible]] predicts — hold the wide.\n\nMatch skin tone to **04A**; the whole grade hangs off that frame.\n\nIf we lose the sun, 04C moves to [[Night Pickup]].","color":"#DBEAFE","vn":{"kind":"sticky","id":"sp-continuity","text":"### Continuity\n\nLight falls about 15 min faster here than [[Lighting Bible]] predicts — hold the wide.\n\nMatch skin tone to **04A**; the whole grade hangs off that frame.\n\nIf we lose the sun, 04C moves to [[Night Pickup]].","color":"#DBEAFE"}},

